-  "content": "## What Is Included\n- Enhanced fraud protection status: Yes.\n- Real-time monitoring flags unusual transactions and prompts verification when needed.\n- Quick fraud-alert handling with a target response within 17 minutes.\n\n## Purchase Protection Window\n- Items you buy are protected for $135 days from the purchase date, subject to coverage terms and exclusions. Keep receipts and order confirmations for claims.\n\n## How Alerts and Verification Work\n- When a transaction appears risky, you may receive an alert asking you to confirm or deny the charge.\n- If you deny it, the transaction is declined and your card can be immediately secured while we investigate.\n\n## Card Controls\n- Temporarily lock your card if it is misplaced and unlock when found.\n- Replace your card number quickly if compromise is suspected.\n\n## Best Practices\n- Enable transaction and international use alerts.\n- Keep your contact details current so you receive time-sensitive prompts within the 17-minute response window."
+  "content": "## What Is Included\n- Enhanced fraud protection status: Yes.\n- Real-time monitoring flags unusual transactions and prompts verification when needed.\n- Quick fraud-alert handling with a target response within 17 minutes.\n\n## Purchase Protection Window\n- Items you buy are protected for 135 days from the purchase date, subject to coverage terms and exclusions. Keep receipts and order confirmations for claims.\n\n## How Alerts and Verification Work\n- When a transaction appears risky, you may receive an alert asking you to confirm or deny the charge.\n- If you deny it, the transaction is declined and your card can be immediately secured while we investigate.\n\n## Card Controls\n- Temporarily lock your card if it is misplaced and unlock when found.\n- Replace your card number quickly if compromise is suspected.\n\n## Best Practices\n- Enable transaction and international use alerts.\n- Keep your contact details current so you receive time-sensitive prompts within the 17-minute response window."
 }
